{"unit_id": "tag:01TB:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>是雅可布森（Jacobson）的；\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的闭点（closed points）的集合（set）；\n<STRUCT_0004>对任意局部有限型（locally of finite type）的<MATH_0005>，\n闭点（closed points）映射（map）到闭点（closed points）；以及\n<STRUCT_0005>对任意局部有限型（locally of finite type）的<MATH_0006>，\n闭点（closed points）<MATH_0007>映射（map）到闭点（closed points）<MATH_0008>，且\n<MATH_0009>有限（finite）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅可布森"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理开头指定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "四个条件之间的逻辑关系。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一项所述性质的对象。"}, {"source_term": "Jacobson", "target_term": "雅可布森", "context": "第一项中概形的性质。"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "第二项所述集合的元素。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "第二项中由闭点组成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "第三项中全称量化对象所须满足的条件。"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "第三项中的原像点。"}, {"so